    'Off-road car': 'Coche todoterreno',
    'Official Material 3 motion patterns from the animations package: container transform, shared axis, fade through, and a fade-scale modal. Ready-made transitions, verified against the spec.': 'Patrones de movimiento oficiales de Material 3 del paquete animations: container transform, shared axis, fade through, y un modal fade-scale. Transiciones listas para usar, verificadas contra la especificación.',
    'Official Material patterns: card → screen, shared axis, fade through.': 'Patrones oficiales de Material: tarjeta → pantalla, eje compartido, fade through.',
