    'Which elements spring': 'Quels éléments rebondissent',
    'Which layer (keypath)': 'Quel calque (keypath)',
    'Which property changes': 'Quelle propriété change',
    'Whole pass (3 transitions)': 'Passage complet (3 transitions)',
    'Width': 'Largeur',
