    '{\n  "name": "Badge swing",\n  "duration_ms": 2000,\n  "repeat": "loop",\n  "origin": [0.5, 0],\n  "curve": "easeInOutSine",\n  "keyframes": [\n    { "at": 0, "rotate": 0 },\n    { "at": 0.2, "rotate": 14 },\n    { "at": 0.4, "rotate": -10 },\n    { "at": 0.6, "rotate": 6 },\n    { "at": 0.8, "rotate": -3 },\n    { "at": 1, "rotate": 0 }\n  ]\n}': '{\n  "name": "Balancement du badge",\n  "duration_ms": 2000,\n  "repeat": "loop",\n  "origin": [0.5, 0],\n  "curve": "easeInOutSine",\n  "keyframes": [\n    { "at": 0, "rotate": 0 },\n    { "at": 0.2, "rotate": 14 },\n    { "at": 0.4, "rotate": -10 },\n    { "at": 0.6, "rotate": 6 },\n    { "at": 0.8, "rotate": -3 },\n    { "at": 1, "rotate": 0 }\n  ]\n}',
    '{\n  "name": "Card appearance",\n  "duration_ms": 1400,\n  "repeat": "loop",\n  "keyframes": [\n    { "at": 0, "opacity": 0, "y": 60, "scale": 0.85, "rotate": -6 },\n    { "at": 0.45, "opacity": 1, "y": -8, "scale": 1.03, "rotate": 1,\n      "curve": "cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)" },\n    { "at": 0.7, "y": 0, "scale": 1, "rotate": 0, "curve": "spring(300, 20, 1)" },\n    { "at": 1 }\n  ]\n}': '{\n  "name": "Apparition de la carte",\n  "duration_ms": 1400,\n  "repeat": "loop",\n  "keyframes": [\n    { "at": 0, "opacity": 0, "y": 60, "scale": 0.85, "rotate": -6 },\n    { "at": 0.45, "opacity": 1, "y": -8, "scale": 1.03, "rotate": 1,\n      "curve": "cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)" },\n    { "at": 0.7, "y": 0, "scale": 1, "rotate": 0, "curve": "spring(300, 20, 1)" },\n    { "at": 1 }\n  ]\n}',
    '{\n  "name": "Frames from After Effects (30 fps)",\n  "duration_ms": 1000,\n  "fps": 30,\n  "repeat": "loop",\n  "keyframes": [\n    { "frame": 0, "x": -80, "opacity": 0, "skew": [20, 0] },\n    { "frame": 12, "x": 10, "opacity": 1, "skew": [-6, 0],\n      "curve": "cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.2, 1)" },\n    { "frame": 18, "x": 0, "skew": [0, 0], "curve": "easeOutBack" },\n    { "frame": 30, "x": 0 }\n  ]\n}': '{\n  "name": "Images depuis After Effects (30 fps)",\n  "duration_ms": 1000,\n  "fps": 30,\n  "repeat": "loop",\n  "keyframes": [\n    { "frame": 0, "x": -80, "opacity": 0, "skew": [20, 0] },\n    { "frame": 12, "x": 10, "opacity": 1, "skew": [-6, 0],\n      "curve": "cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.2, 1)" },\n    { "frame": 18, "x": 0, "skew": [0, 0], "curve": "easeOutBack" },\n    { "frame": 30, "x": 0 }\n  ]\n}',
    '{\n  "name": "Matrices from Figma (Copy as CSS)",\n  "duration_ms": 2400,\n  "repeat": "ping-pong",\n  "curve": "cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1)",\n  "keyframes": [\n    { "at": 0, "css": "matrix(1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0)" },\n    { "at": 0.5, "css": "translate(40px, -20px) rotate(-15deg) scale(1.15)" },\n    { "at": 1, "matrix": "matrix(0.866, 0.5, -0.5, 0.866, -30, 10)" }\n  ]\n}': '{\n  "name": "Matrices de Figma (Copy as CSS)",\n  "duration_ms": 2400,\n  "repeat": "ping-pong",\n  "curve": "cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1)",\n  "keyframes": [\n    { "at": 0, "css": "matrix(1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0)" },\n    { "at": 0.5, "css": "translate(40px, -20px) rotate(-15deg) scale(1.15)" },\n    { "at": 1, "matrix": "matrix(0.866, 0.5, -0.5, 0.866, -30, 10)" }\n  ]\n}',
    '{\n  "name": "Pulse invitation",\n  "duration_ms": 1600,\n  "repeat": "loop",\n  "curve": "easeInOut",\n  "keyframes": [\n    { "at": 0, "scale": 1 },\n    { "at": 0.15, "scale": 1.12 },\n    { "at": 0.3, "scale": 0.97 },\n    { "at": 0.45, "scale": 1.05 },\n    { "at": 0.6, "scale": 1 },\n    { "at": 1, "scale": 1 }\n  ]\n}': '{\n  "name": "Pulsation d\'invitation",\n  "duration_ms": 1600,\n  "repeat": "loop",\n  "curve": "easeInOut",\n  "keyframes": [\n    { "at": 0, "scale": 1 },\n    { "at": 0.15, "scale": 1.12 },\n    { "at": 0.3, "scale": 0.97 },\n    { "at": 0.45, "scale": 1.05 },\n    { "at": 0.6, "scale": 1 },\n    { "at": 1, "scale": 1 }\n  ]\n}',
    '×2, reverse direction': '×2, sens inverse',
    '• Material app, strict style, dense lists → InkWell.\n• iOS style, games, promos, large cards and CTAs → Bounceable.\n• Bounceable doesn\'t draw a ripple or change color — if you also need a color response, add it separately.\n• Bounceable\'s parameters come from the "Response settings" block.': '• Appli Material, style strict, listes denses → InkWell.\n• Style iOS, jeux, promos, grandes cartes et CTA → Bounceable.\n• Bounceable ne dessine pas d\'onde et ne change pas de couleur — si une réponse colorée est aussi nécessaire, ajoutez-la séparément.\n• Les paramètres de Bounceable viennent du bloc « Réglages de réponse ».',
