    'Rotate / Fade / Typer / Typewriter / Scale / Colorize / TextLiquidFill / Wavy / Flicker / Scramble / Bounce, or a chain of them': 'Rotate / Fade / Typer / Typewriter / Scale / Colorize / TextLiquidFill / Wavy / Flicker / Scramble / Bounce oder eine Kette davon',
